WEBVTT

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:52.680
Once upon a time there
lived an evil ogre.

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:59.320
It went on a rampage and caused
many innocent villagers to suffer.

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:02.830
Suddenly a monkey monk appeared...

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:08.370
He exorcised the ogre and
sealed it away.

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:16.610
So this is where the evil ogre
was sealed away.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:23.850
Precisely. This is the seal
the monkey monk used. However...

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:29.590
...the writing is wearing off and
soon the ogre will be set free.

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:35.660
So we're supposed to guard the
thing while you replace the seal.

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.140
Oh, no!

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.440
Hurry! Make sure
the box doesn't open!

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:44.570
Gotcha covered!

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:47.140
Fighting evil is a martial artist's duty!

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:48.440
Hurry it up with that seal, will you!?

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:51.880
Here I go! Be sealed away...

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.890
Summer colds just hang on, don't they?

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:05.420
The gang's here! What're you up to?

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:06.970
That's what...

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:08.400
...we were going to...

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:10.700
- ASK YOU!

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:14.400
He should be disbarred
from martial arts!

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:15.640
That's what you get!

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:17.270
A true travesty!

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.570
'Scuse me...

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.840
Curses! It's coming out!

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:22.580
Uh oh...

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.950
Foolish mortals!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:31.050
I have been caged for a thousand years!

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:37.790
And now you shall feel my wrath!

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:41.170
I-It can't be...

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.580
This is your "evil ogre"?

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:03.920
I-I think so...

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:09.790
P-Pops!

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:16.760
S-Saotome!

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:28.440
Pops, you got horns!

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:29.980
He's possessed by the ogre!

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:33.540
N-No, don't, Saotome!

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:36.390
S-STAY AWAY!

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:38.390
POPS, DON'T!!

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:44.130
Hee, hee, hee, hee, hee...

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:44.130
When you are possessed by the
ogre, evil fills your heart.

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:46.790
You become a bad person!

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:49.530
How do you defeat it?

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:53.400
One good punch will
drive the ogre out.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.980
Now you did it! You let it out!

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.610
I'll just grab it agai... Huh?

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:08.010
Upperclassman Kuno.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.590
Why?

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:14.680
Why should such a loving heart
as mine be consumed with evil?

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.820
En garde!

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:19.900
Ranma Saotome! Prepare to die!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:20.870
C'mon!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:24.860
You haven't changed a bit!

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.470
Incredible!

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:30.500
Soun Tendo Wuz Here!

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:32.770
Incompetent

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:32.770
No-good bum!
Get a haircut already!

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.000
Geh heh heh heh heh...

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.850
I want an air-conditioner!

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.000
Gah hah hah...Evil impulse...

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:43.450
Saotome, you're not
possessed anymore.

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:56.200
Akane!

00:05:56.300 --> 00:06:00.500
This time I want to express
the feelings that fill my heart!

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:04.370
Feelings as clear as the sunlight
in this early summer sky.

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:07.240
Burning hotter and hotter...

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.220
Ryoga!

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:27.630
I, Ryoga Hibiki, will indulge
my sudden urge to do evil!

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:29.670
Yeah, yeah. Geez.

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:31.900
You're gonna owe me, Ryoga!

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:34.170
'Cause now I'm gonna knock
some sense back into you!

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:42.440
No one can come between
me and my evil urges!

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.920
Just you wait, Akane.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:54.630
If it isn't Ryoga.

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:57.200
Make yourself at home. Akane
is in the bath at the moment...

00:06:58.470 --> 00:06:59.660
Don't mind me.

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:02.670
I'll make myself right at home!

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:09.610
Welcome home, Ranma.
You just missed Ryoga...

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:11.680
Ryoga, hold it!

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.640
Akane's in the bath...

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:16.140
You just wait up!

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:18.650
I told you to freeze!

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:26.690
I-I got my reasons...

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.560
Tell 'em to th' HEAVENS!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:37.500
Honestly! I can't let my
guard down for a minute...

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:45.770
Oh, great! Everything's going wrong!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:53.410
P-chan! What're you doing in here!?

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.460
Hang on a sec. I gotta change clothes.

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:03.120
What was Ranma doing,
leaving the bathroom door open?

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:09.360
Right, P-chan?
So I took a bath at an odd hour.

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:12.130
That's no reason to come barging in...

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:17.800
Akane, Kasumi says that...

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.400
...Ryoga's here.

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:22.410
P-chan!? Are you okay!?

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.180
Whoops. Sorry.

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:32.450
That ought to do it.

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:34.690
Do what, if I may ask?

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:36.920
I've just put up the wards.

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:39.830
Now the ogre
can't get out of the house.

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:41.960
But what about the shopping?

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:43.500
No one can leave.

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:50.640
Ranma, welcome home... again.

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:52.650
That would mean...

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.450
Those are tough wards!

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:04.920
But what about
the shopping, though...?

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:10.690
You mean... we can't leave either?

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:11.420
Right.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.900
We must limit the damage it can cause.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:22.170
Since you let it go free,
its capture is your responsibility.

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:25.800
You're making too much
of that little runt ogre.

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:28.210
Do something, Daddy.

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:33.910
Easier said than done. We have
no idea of where it's hiding.

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.100
Or maybe...

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:38.500
...it's not hiding in the house at all...

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.500
Maybe right now, the ogre
is hiding inside one of us!

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:44.060
Someone right here?

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:12.860
Ranma!

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:16.860
You're the one
possessed by the ogre, right?

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:18.090
WHAT!?

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:22.070
The real Ranma would be giving
me a nice backrub right now...

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:26.730
When did I EVER do that?
YOU'RE the one possessed!

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:31.140
Stop that, both of you. It's unmanly.

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:36.810
But if someone was possessed,
they'd have horns, right?

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:37.910
We'd see them.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:41.890
No, the horns need
not protrude from the head.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:42.820
For example...

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:45.580
They could protrude
from the soles of the feet.

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:47.850
Who could stand that?

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:50.900
Isn't there some easy
way to tell who's possessed?

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:53.560
There is.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:56.760
Tie up the accused very tightly...

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:00.340
...and dump him in the lake.

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:01.100
Goodness...

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:02.140
Ranma!

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:03.900
If he drowns, he was innocent.

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:08.640
If he floats, it's proof
he was possessed after all.

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:12.580
Ranma!

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:16.280
If you're going to test people,
take the test yourself first!

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:21.950
Horns!

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:30.360
You're under arrest!

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:35.740
Cheers!

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:40.370
Well, well. This case is closed!

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:44.780
We can bind up an ogre
or two before breakfast!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:50.020
Thank you so much. I just
had all these evil urges...

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:55.250
Everything's prepared.
Now eat every bite.

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:57.530
Thank you!

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.970
Kno...

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:04.400
Knock out...

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:06.200
Knock out powder...

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:09.640
Please forgive me.

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:15.670
I just had this sudden evil urge.

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:19.180
K-Kasumi!
You've got horns on your head!

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:21.020
Impossible! The ogre...

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:23.590
...is sealed away with a ward!

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:26.120
Prayer for Safe Childbirth

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:26.120
Wrong ward.

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:35.060
Oh, my.

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:52.350
Here you go, Ranma! All done.

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:56.350
Cross-Dresser

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:54.910
Uh, thanks.

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:56.350
This is wrinkled.

00:12:56.990 --> 00:12:58.650
Ready?

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:05.900
Father, I've laid out
your bedding for you.

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:08.990
Th-Thank you, Kasumi.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:12.200
The evil ogre. You got THAT right.

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:14.770
Can't we do something!?

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:18.010
Quit pushing, Saotome!

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:25.580
One good punch and it's gone.
But could I hit Kasumi...?

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:29.980
Anyone who would hit
Kasumi will feel my wrath!

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:32.420
I just said I couldn't hit her!

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:38.090
No matter how much
it may hurt now...

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:41.400
...the love of one's family
can get one through anything.

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:47.430
We must show our love for
Kasumi and protect her.

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:49.970
Dad.

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:52.410
Daddy.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.240
There's gotta be another way.

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:56.440
But she's heaven
compared to the old lecher...

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:58.110
Excuse me...

00:13:58.220 --> 00:14:01.150
Father, would you like a backrub?

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:03.450
K-Kasumi!

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:13.330
Doesn't that feel good?

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:16.100
It feels wonderful, Kasumi.

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.220
Who's there?

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:16.720
Now isn't that odd?

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:23.230
Oh, dear. There's that evil urge.

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:40.980
My! How cute!

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:53.200
Delivery!

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:54.060
Coming!

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:58.130
Deluxe sushi for ten,
just like you ordered.

00:15:58.240 --> 00:15:59.430
Thank you.

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:03.410
Normally I would never deliver
this early in the morning.

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:07.450
But since it's you, Kasumi,
I couldn't refuse.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:13.150
Delivery! First-class tempura
shrimp and noodle soup for seven!

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:14.810
Thank you.

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:20.290
Normally I would never deliver
this early in the morning.

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:23.760
But since it's you, Kasumi...

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.560
Nine orders of eel rice bowl!

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:26.330
Hello.

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:30.160
Normally I would never deliver
this early in the morning...

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:31.740
What is the meaning of this!?

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:37.070
Forgive me.
I suddenly had this evil urge...

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:40.210
We'll come with the bill later!

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:43.250
They walked
right through your wards.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:46.750
No, the wards only block
those who try to leave.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:56.260
See?

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:57.490
Listen...

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:18.080
So we can never pass those wards
until the ogre's sealed away?

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:21.090
You mean I didn't tell you?

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:23.220
You never said a word!

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:25.090
Then be at peace.

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:29.630
If you let it be,
the ogre will leave on its own.

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.030
Really?

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:36.630
Once it has ruined the person's
life completely, that is.

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:37.430
Oh, my!

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:40.340
What!? You never said that!!

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:43.530
Are you sure I didn't mention it?

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:46.340
Not a word!!

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:51.410
We haven't a moment to lose.

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.190
This is our last resort.

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:59.120
Tendo, what are you...

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:00.660
Kasumi.

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:03.150
Father...?

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:08.560
Your father is basically a shy man.

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:14.660
And I know I haven't thanked
you enough for all you've done.

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:19.470
I am truly sorry.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:26.480
Father...

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:31.050
Now hear this, evil ogre!

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:35.050
I will not allow you
to torture Kasumi anymore.

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:40.030
If you agree to leave her...

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:43.270
Tendo, you can't...

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:46.530
...I will happily give my life to you!

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.370
What was that?

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.100
Y-You can't do this!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:52.270
This is MY decision!

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:55.750
Tendo, what a man you are!

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:56.810
Daddy!

00:18:57.350 --> 00:18:59.680
Father!

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:29.380
Tendo!

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:31.310
Dad!

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:33.610
Stay back!

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:38.380
Dad!

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.360
No! You can't be...

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:48.560
Ranma, Akane, exorcise the
ogre and me, together!

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:52.500
W-What a man you are!

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:54.800
D-Do it now!

00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:58.840
N-Nabiki, we...

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:02.380
H-Hurry! Do it now!

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:10.310
Father!

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.190
H-Hurry!

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:27.770
I guess I'm not possessed yet!

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:34.280
Tendo, a man like you should be...

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:37.820
But what'll we do?
We can't let this go on.

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.780
Gotta be something we can do.

00:20:39.890 --> 00:20:43.880
I thought it would come to this.

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:48.320
I suppose you must leave this to me,
a trained professional.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:52.430
I can put this new improved
ward on the victim's forehead...

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:54.300
...and the ogre will leave
automatically!

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:57.800
Why didn't you say that
in the first place!?

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:09.580
Oh dear, what have I done?

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:11.410
I'm so happy, Kasumi!

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:12.490
Kasumi!

00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:14.380
Hey, look at that!

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:21.420
It's probably fed on
enough evil desires already.

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:31.730
Curses! Just a little more and
I'd have been completely revived!

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:43.950
But now I am free!

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:47.920
Oh, no! We have to stop it before
it possesses someone else!

00:21:48.020 --> 00:21:49.550
Got it!

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.590
Fighting evil is...

00:21:51.690 --> 00:21:52.680
...a martial artist's duty!

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:57.360
P-chan!

00:22:02.740 --> 00:22:03.500
Take this!

00:22:10.310 --> 00:22:15.580
It may be an evil ogre, but can
it take a full attack of wards?

00:22:15.680 --> 00:22:18.520
That's my boy!

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:21.920
What?

00:22:29.230 --> 00:22:31.600
Bakusai Tenketsu!

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:37.800
Don't let your guard down, Ranma!

00:22:37.900 --> 00:22:42.670
Sorry. But why didn't
those wards work?

00:22:45.410 --> 00:22:46.070
What's this?

00:22:46.980 --> 00:22:50.070
Shouldn't the character
have one more stroke...?

00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:53.580
That was YOUR boy?

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:03.620
I have to keep my collection together.

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:05.100
What are you doing here?

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:05.820
Old man!

00:23:07.770 --> 00:23:10.630
What a splendidly evil heart he has.

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:15.300
If I could possess him
I could be completely revived!

00:23:15.410 --> 00:23:16.640
D-Don't!

00:23:16.740 --> 00:23:17.540
Damn!

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:30.920
Whaddya get when you cross an
ogre with an evil master!?

00:23:31.020 --> 00:23:33.550
A Blight on Bald Mountain?

00:23:44.740 --> 00:23:48.730
Now I can wreak
my vengeance on the world!

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:53.610
He's looking weird.

00:23:53.710 --> 00:23:54.680
My...

00:23:54.780 --> 00:23:55.750
What's going on?

00:23:56.250 --> 00:23:59.080
The ogre is in terrible agony!

00:23:59.990 --> 00:24:06.390
Perhaps the ogre can't compete
with the master's own evil?

00:24:06.790 --> 00:24:11.250
That's just too much to believe!

00:24:14.730 --> 00:24:16.930
Now, Ranma!

00:24:19.770 --> 00:24:21.540
Evil seal!

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:41.720
The new seal ought to be
good for another thousand years.

00:24:41.830 --> 00:24:46.490
Let's hope it flows out to the
middle of some deserted ocean.

00:24:46.600 --> 00:24:51.090
That kind of monster will
probably never revive again.

00:24:55.780 --> 00:24:59.070
That was a creepy enemy.
Strong, too.

00:24:59.750 --> 00:25:02.980
Won't the ink dissolve in the water?

00:25:03.850 --> 00:25:07.980
And that box was pretty banged up.

00:25:08.790 --> 00:25:11.780
It's a good thing the lecher
master was sealed in there, too!

00:25:11.890 --> 00:25:15.020
We got a jerk in the box.
Good one, huh?

00:25:15.130 --> 00:25:17.720
Saotome, you're such a wit!

00:25:23.570 --> 00:25:30.030
Two enormous monsters appeared
on a California beach.

00:25:30.840 --> 00:25:35.340
This just in: We now
have video of the two monsters!

00:25:36.850 --> 00:25:41.550
According to our investigative
reports, they crossed the ocean.

00:25:41.650 --> 00:25:46.920
In other words, present theory
states that they came from Asia.

00:25:47.930 --> 00:25:55.930
The US army, navy, and air
force have been mobilized to...
